            <ArticleTitle>[Simultaneous operations through mini-approach in patients with multifocal atherosclerosis and cholelithiasis].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>25-30</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The experience with simultaneous operations in 16 patients with multifocal atherosclerosis and cholelithiasis is analyzed. The operations were performed simultaneously through two mini-approaches with original &quot;mini-assistant&quot; devices. Short- and long-term postoperative results are analyzed, indications and surgical techniques through mini-approach in elderly patients are reported.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
